sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Platform as ODH/RHOAI Platform Operator
    participant API as Kubernetes API Server<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Module as feast-module-operator<br/>SA: opendatahub-feast-operator
    participant FS as Local FS /opt/manifests<br/>emptyDir
    participant Feast as Feast Operator<br/>feast-operator-controller-manager
    participant Prom as Prometheus<br/>monitoring namespace

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
    Note over Platform,Feast: Flow 1 - Platform enables Feast
    Platform->>API: Helm install module chart<br/>create FeastOperator default-feastoperator<br/>Auth: Platform operator SA
    Module->>API: Watch FeastOperator, read odh-data-config,<br/>read APIServer TLS profile<br/>Auth: SA token
    API-->>Module: FeastOperator spec - oidc, capabilities
    Module->>FS: Render kustomize overlay rhoai or odh<br/>write params.env images + OIDC_ISSUER_URL
    FS-->>Module: Rendered Feast manifests
    Module->>API: Create/label rhoai-data-registry namespace<br/>CreateOrUpdate feast-capabilities-config
    Module->>API: Apply FeatureStore CRD, Feast Deployment,<br/>RBAC, metrics Service, ServiceMonitor
    Module->>API: Patch Deployment annotation<br/>feast.dev/capabilities-hash if changed
    Module->>API: Update FeastOperator status<br/>Ready, DeploymentsAvailable, releases
    API-->>Feast: Rollout picks up capabilities ConfigMap
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
    Note over Platform,Feast: Flow 2 - Uninstall finalizer handshake
    Platform->>API: Delete FeastOperator<br/>Auth: SA token
    API-->>Module: deletionTimestamp set
    Module->>API: Remove namespace label, write capabilities=false,<br/>roll Feast Deployment, delete ConfigMap
    Feast->>API: Tear down Data Registry workloads<br/>remove feast.dev/capabilities-config-cleanup finalizer<br/>Auth: Feast SA
    Module->>API: Wait up to 5 min - on timeout emit<br/>CapabilitiesCleanupTimeout event
    Module->>API: Release own finalizer,<br/>delete labelled ClusterRoles/Bindings
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over Module,Prom: Flow 3 - Metrics scrape
    Prom->>Module: GET /metrics via opendatahub-feast-metrics-service<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS self-signed TLS<br/>Auth: Bearer token TokenReview + SAR
    Module-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics
    end
